{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09024","headline":"朝请後还邑寄诸友生 · 韦应物","name":"朝请後还邑寄诸友生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宰邑分甸服，夙驾朝上京。\n是时当暮春，休沐集友生。\n抗志青云表，俱践高世名。\n樽酒且欢乐，文翰亦纵横。\n良游昔所希，累讌夜复明。\n晨露含瑶琴，夕风殒素英。\n一旦遵归路，伏轼出京城。\n谁言再念别，忽若千里行。\n闲合寡喧讼，端居结幽情。\n况兹昼方永，展转何由平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09024.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09024","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}